<view class="page">
  <view class="brand">{{appName}}</view>
  <view class="hero">从适合自己的<text class="hero-line">节奏开始。</text></view>
  <view class="muted intro">选择一项运动，为下一次进步做好准备。</view>
  <view class="section-heading"><text>今天练什么？</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{sortOptions}}" value="{{sortIndex}}" bindchange="onSortChange"><view class="sort-picker">{{sortOptions[sortIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view>
  <view class="exercise-grid">
    <navigator wx:for="{{exercises}}" wx:key="id" class="exercise-tile" url="{{item.trainingUrl}}" hover-class="button-hover">
      <view class="tile-top"><text class="type-tag {{item.isTimed ? 'type-timed' : ''}}">{{item.typeLabel}}</text></view>
      <view class="exercise-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="tile-unit">{{item.unit}} / 组</view>
      <view class="tile-unit">{{item.usageLabel}}</view>
    </navigator>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{storageWarning}}" class="opt-warning">{{storageWarning}}</view>
  <view class="muted availability">俯卧撑用光学；仰卧起坐以加速度为主、旋转为辅；深蹲用胸前陀螺仪；平板支撑用计时器。自动检测效果待真机验证。</view>
  <navigator class="record-link" url="/pages/history/index" open-type="switchTab" hover-class="button-hover">查看训练记录 <text aria-hidden="true">›</text></navigator>
</view>
